# 🌍 Musafir

Musafir is a cinematic travel exploration website for discovering countries, destinations, places, weather information and travel details through an interactive globe experience.

## ✨ Features

- 🌎 Interactive 3D Globe
- 🗺️ Country & destination exploration
- 🌦️ Weather information
- 📍 Travel destinations and local places
- 🔎 Smart search
- 🧭 Get Directions
- 📱 Responsive mobile-friendly design
- 🤖 AI-powered travel information
- 🚀 Deployed on Vercel

